_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-061-gouxi","book_id":"b-jinshu-061","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-061-gouxi-ws7903772"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-gouxi:p012","text":"五年，帝復詔晞曰：「太傅信用奸佞，阻兵專權，內不遵奉皇憲，外不協比方州，遂令戎狄充斥，所在犯暴。留軍何倫抄掠宮寺，劫剝公主，殺害賢士，悖亂天下，不可忍聞。雖惟親親，宜明九伐。詔至之日，其宣告天下，率齊大舉，桓文之績，一以委公。其思盡諸宜，善建弘略。道澀，故練寫副，手筆示意。」晞表曰：「奉被手詔，委臣征討，喻以桓文，紙練兼備，伏讀跪歎，五情惶怛。自頃宰臣專制，委杖佞邪，內擅朝威，外殘兆庶，矯詔專征，遂圖不軌，縱兵寇掠，陵踐宮寺。前司隸校尉劉暾、御史中丞溫畿、右將軍杜育，並見攻劫。廣平、武安公主，先帝遺體，咸被逼辱。逆節虐亂，莫此之甚。輒祗奉前詔，部分諸軍，遣王贊率陳午等將兵詣項，龔行天罰。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":88,"last_line":88,"raw_start":6763,"raw_end":7063,"raw_character_offsets":[6765,6766,6767,6768,6769,6770,6771,6772,6773,6774,6775,6776,6777,6778,6779,6780,6781,6782,6783,6784,6785,6786,6787,6788,6789,6790,6791,6792,6793,6794,6795,6796,6797,6798,6799,6800,6801,6802,6803,6804,6805,6806,6807,6808,6809,6810,6811,6812,6813,6814,6815,6816,6817,6818,6819,6820,6821,6822,6823,6824,6825,6826,6827,6828,6829,6830,6831,6832,6833,6834,6835,6836,6837,6838,6839,6840,6841,6842,6843,6844,6845,6846,6847,6848,6849,6850,6851,6852,6853,6854,6855,6856,6857,6858,6859,6860,6861,6862,6863,6864,6865,6866,6867,6868,6869,6870,6871,6872,6873,6874,6875,6876,6877,6878,6879,6880,6881,6882,6883,6884,6885,6886,6887,6888,6889,6890,6891,6892,6893,6894,6895,6896,6897,6898,6899,6900,6901,6902,6903,6904,6905,6906,6907,6908,6909,6910,6911,6912,6913,6914,6915,6916,6917,6918,6919,6920,6921,6922,6923,6924,6925,6926,6927,6928,6929,6930,6931,6932,6933,6934,6935,6936,6937,6938,6939,6940,6941,6942,6943,6944,6945,6946,6947,6948,6949,6950,6951,6952,6953,6954,6955,6956,6957,6958,6959,6960,6961,6962,6963,6964,6965,6966,6967,6968,6969,6970,6971,6972,6973,6974,6975,6976,6977,6978,6979,6980,6981,6982,6983,6984,6985,6986,6987,6988,6989,6990,6991,6992,6993,6994,6995,6996,6997,6998,6999,7000,7001,7002,7003,7004,7005,7006,7007,7008,7009,7010,7011,7012,7013,7014,7015,7016,7017,7018,7019,7020,7021,7022,7023,7024,7025,7026,7027,7028,7029,7030,7031,7032,7033,7034,7035,7036,7037,7038,7039,7040,7041,7042,7043,7044,7045,7046,7047,7048,7049,7050,7051,7052,7053,7054,7055,7056,7057,7058,7059,7060,7061,7062],"revision_id":7903772},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-061-gouxi:p012:m0006","surface":"晞","start":6,"end":7,"person_id":"v5s_1ew_vh0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-gouxi:p012:m0050","surface":"何倫","start":50,"end":52,"person_id":"kiu_4yi_h81","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-gouxi:p012:m0138","surface":"晞","start":138,"end":139,"person_id":"v5s_1ew_vh0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-gouxi:p012:m0220","surface":"劉暾","start":220,"end":222,"person_id":"mbq_jhy_9er","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-gouxi:p012:m0227","surface":"溫畿","start":227,"end":229,"person_id":"1nq_ikq_xut","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-gouxi:p012:m0233","surface":"杜育","start":233,"end":235,"person_id":"7eg_jgh_zgj","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-gouxi:p012:m0241","surface":"廣平","start":241,"end":243,"person_id":"de1_i6j_2qu","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-gouxi:p012:m0244","surface":"武安公主","start":244,"end":248,"person_id":"ow9_krl_b4a","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-gouxi:p012:m0281","surface":"王贊","start":281,"end":283,"person_id":"i0y_g49_jd6","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-gouxi:p012:m0284","surface":"陳午","start":284,"end":286,"person_id":"dcs_ymm_847","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-061-gouxi","book_id":"b-jinshu-061","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-061-gouxi-ws7903772"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line070","text":"郗鑒，字道徽，高平金鄉人，漢御史大夫慮之玄孫也。少孤貧，博覽經籍，躬耕隴畝，吟詠不倦。以儒雅著名，不應州命。趙王倫辟為掾，知倫有不臣之迹，稱疾去職。及倫篡，其黨皆至大官，而鑒閉門自守，不染逆節。惠帝反正，參司空軍事，累遷太子中舍人、中書侍郎。東海王越辟為主簿，舉賢良，不行。征東大將軍苟晞檄為從事中郎。晞與越方以力爭，鑒不應其召。從兄旭，晞之別駕，恐禍及己，勸之赴召，鑒終不廻，晞亦不之逼也。及京師不守，寇難鋒起，鑒遂陷於陳午賊中。邑人張實先求交於鑒，鑒不許。至是，實於午營來省鑒疾，既而卿鑒。鑒謂實曰：「相與邦壤，義不及通，何可怙亂至此邪！」實大慙而退。午以鑒有名於世，將逼為主，鑒逃而獲免。午尋潰散，鑒得歸鄉里。于時所在饑荒，州中之士素有感其恩義者，相與資贍。鑒復分所得，以賉宗族及鄉曲孤老，賴而全濟者甚多，咸相謂曰：「今天子播越，中原無伯，當歸依仁德，可以後亡。」遂共推鑒為主，舉千餘家俱避難於魯之嶧山。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line070:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"郗鑒","kind":"person","person_id":"6lr_zci_i0j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line070:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"道徽","kind":"person","person_id":"6lr_zci_i0j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line070:m0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"慮","kind":"person","person_id":"66f_b00_777","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line070:m0054","start":54,"end":57,"surface":"趙王倫","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line070:m0062","start":62,"end":63,"surface":"倫","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line070:m0075","start":75,"end":76,"surface":"倫","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line070:m0086","start":86,"end":87,"surface":"鑒","kind":"person","person_id":"6lr_zci_i0j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line070:m0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"惠帝","kind":"person","person_id":"7e0_f69_1ac","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line070:m0121","start":121,"end":125,"surface":"東海王越","kind":"person","person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","status":"contextual_provisio